OL,3,GNEWSAKing, Queen and Prince William to
OL,4,Avisit Aberfan on 60th anniversary of
OL,5,Adisaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King, Queen and Prince of Wales are
OL,8,Fset to visit Aberfan later this month
OL,9,Fto mark the 60th anniversary of the
OL,10,Fdisaster which killed 116 children and
OL,11,F28 adults.
OL,13,FPantglas Junior School and surrounding
OL,14,Fhouses in the village near Merthyr
OL,15,FTydfil, south Wales, were
OL,16,Fcatastrophically engulfed in coal
OL,17,Fslurry after the colliery spoil tip
OL,18,Fcollapsed on 21 October 1966.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
