OL,3,GNEWSAKing, Queen and Prince William to
OL,4,Avisit Aberfan on 60th anniversary of
OL,5,Adisaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FKing Charles III, Queen Camilla and
OL,8,FPrince William will join survivors,
OL,9,Fbereaved parents and members of the
OL,10,Fcommunity on the anniversary to pay
OL,11,Ftribute to those who died.
OL,13,FThe royals will visit the Aberfan
OL,14,FMemorial Garden which stands on the
OL,15,Fsite of the primary school, and go to
OL,16,Fthe Aberfan and Merthyr Vale Community
OL,17,FCentre.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
